d only if Spring preconfiguration is explicitly required.\n\n3. **Dead timeline response state**\n   - File: `E:\\Projects\\Code\\AI\\Ji\\ji-java\\applications\\ji-host-web\\src\\main\\java\\io\\github\\diodeme\\ji\\host\\web\\LocalHostServer.java:284`\n   - Summary: Every timeline response includes `newerCursor`, but it is permanently `\"\"`; neither `TimelinePage` nor any scoped implementation can produce a newer cursor.\n   - Concrete cost: Clients and fixtures must model and preserve a field with no possible behavior, and future engineers may incorrectly treat bidirectional pagination as supported. Either omit it until implemented or add actual newer-page semantics.\n\nNo edits were made."},{"id":"assistant-thought-agent-b998177cc3ed5f039fb177513532ff7f-resp_079aeea3cfe80848016a9bb26937e087d0b37e7096f0911b45","kind":"thoughtDelta","sessionId":"b3c3636e-0f88-425f-958f-919984f20e84","seq":22225,"startedSeq":22225,"endedSeq":22225,"timestamp":"1788588655Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"agent-b998177cc3ed5f039fb177513532ff7f","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"**Finalizing candidate transmission approach**"},{"id":"tool-call-call_Hd8OuHO9A0q58NRP0OJ5xrPf","kind":"toolCall","title":"SendMessage","status":"completed","toolCallId":"call_Hd8OuHO9A0q58NRP0OJ5xrPf","sessionId":"b3c3636e-0f88-425f-958f-919984f20e84","seq":22233,"startedSeq":22233,"endedSeq":22233,"timestamp":"1788588660Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"agent-b998177cc3ed5f039fb177513532ff7f","toolName":"SendMessage","toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"assistant-message-agent-b998177cc3ed5f039fb177513532ff7f-resp_0c8fb879f0c87861016a9bb277bae087d0912a3c1fe3787582","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"b3c3636e-0f88-425f-958f-919984f20e84","seq":22277,"startedSeq":22277,"endedSeq":22277,"timestamp":"1788588672Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"agent-b998177cc3ed5f039fb177513532ff7f","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}